"dual-grid\">\n          <article class=\"dual-block\">\n            <h3>Logistics TMS</h3>\n            <ul class=\"audience-list\">\n              <li>Forwarders and carriers on PROLOG / ALFAKIT</li>\n              <li>Finance, sales, customs, dispatch</li>\n              <li>Needing customisation, reporting and a stable Domino</li>\n            </ul>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"dual-block\">\n            <h3>Other Domino estates</h3>\n            <ul class=\"audience-list\">\n              <li>Companies on IBM Domino / HCL Notes outside pure logistics</li>\n              <li>Document flow, CRM, industry-specific NSF databases</li>\n              <li>Integrations, load, migration to NEXT</li>\n            </ul>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"stack-title\">Core stack (Domino TMS)</p>\n        <ul class=\"stack-list\">\n          <li>IBM Domino · HCL Notes</li>\n          <li>LotusScript · Java agents · Formula</li>\n          <li>HTTP API · CSV / Excel · ERP and 1C · e-invoicing</li>\n          <li>Exports to QlikView / Power BI</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section cases\" id=\"cases\" aria-labelledby=\"cases-title\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <h2 id=\"cases-title\">Cases</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-lead\">Anonymised. Format: problem → action → result.</p>\n        <ol class=\"case-list\">\n          <li class=\"case\">\n            <h3>Payment import from the accounting system</h3>\n            <p><strong>Problem:</strong> duplicates and truncated invoices when loading multiple currencies.<br />\n            <strong>Action:</strong> CSV exchange, import configurations, tests against real bank statements.<br />\n            <strong>Result:</strong> customer payment import confirmed on production accounts.</p>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"case\">\n            <h3>E-invoicing documents</h3>\n            <p><strong>Problem:</strong> the XML failed the operator’s validation.<br />\n            <strong>Action:</strong> templates plus checks on company details and regions.<br />\n            <strong>Result:</strong> documents accepted by the e-invoicing operator.</p>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"case\">\n            <h3>Reporting for CFO, sales and CEO</h3>\n            <p><strong>Problem:</strong> the only cuts available were heavy TMS views.<br />\n            <strong>Action:</strong> daily exports into QlikView, response time in hours, role-based scenarios.<br />\n            <strong>Result:</strong> separate dashboards for finance, sales and management.</p>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"case\">\n            <h3>Dispatcher and manager roles</h3>\n            <p><strong>Problem:</strong> staff could see other people’s deals and processes were blocked.<br />\n            <strong>Action:</strong> role model, ACL, targeted rights restoration.<br />\n            <strong>Result:</strong> access and processes match the org chart again.</p>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"case\">\n            <h3>Quotation process optimisation</h3>\n            <p><strong>Problem:</strong> requests were lost between departments and response time was never measured.<br />\n            <strong>Action:</strong> as-is and to-be design, queue roles, a response standard, export into BI.<br />\n            <strong>Result:</strong> a transparent queue and handling time measured in hours.</p>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"case\">\n            <h3>TMS export into management reporting</h3>\n            <p><strong>Problem:</strong> manual Excel assembly across several parts of the installation, mismatched keys.<br />\n            <strong>Action:</strong> stable export agents out of Domino, agreed fields for finance and sales.<br />\n            <strong>Result:</strong> daily cuts without manual stitching. A full warehouse from any source runs at <a href=\"https://semperinmotu.com/ops/data.html\">Semper In Motu</a>.</p>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section process\" id=\"process\" aria-labelledby=\"process-title\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <h2 id=\"process-title\">How we work</h2>\n        <ol class=\"process-list\">\n          <li><span class=\"process-step\">01</span><div><h3>Triage</h3><p>Symptom, roles, process or a P1–P3 incident.</p></div></li>\n          <li><span class=\"process-step\">02</span><div><h3>Estimate</h3><p>Live installation, data sources, NEXT roadmap.</p></div></li>\n          <li><span class=\"process-step\">03</span><div><h3>Delivery</h3><p>A module, a report, a support package or a process change inside the system.</p></div></li>\n          <li><span class=\"process-step\">04</span><div><h3>Acceptance</h3><p>On real data, then into steady-state support.</p></div></li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section data-platform\" id=\"bridge\" aria-labelledby=\"bridge-title\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <p class=\"section-kicker\">Adjacent work</p>\n        <h2 id=\"bridge-title\">Data, AI and the agency</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-lead\">\n          alfakit.by is the Domino TMS specialist. Data and AI live at the Semper In Motu agency. The full project portfolio is on <a href=\"https://vitalykhoruzhko.com/\">vitalykhoruzhko.com</a>.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"support-grid\">\n          <article class=\"support-item\">\n            <h3>Data: lake, warehouse, marts</h3>\n            <p>Warehouses and marts from any source, with source discovery before the project.</p>\n            <p class=\"product-who\"><a href=\"https://semperinmotu.com/ops/data.html\">semperinmotu.com/ops/data →</a></p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"support-item\">\n            <h3>AI, SMART and pilots</h3>\n            <p>Conversation intelligence and KPI pilots on top of the operational system.</p>\n            <p class=\"product-who\"><a href=\"https://semperinmotu.com/ops/\">semperinmotu.com/ops →</a></p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"support-item\">\n            <h3>Heritavia</h3>\n            <p>Documented family history — a separate service.</p>\n            <p class=\"product-who\"><a href=\"https://heritavia.vitalykhoruzhko.com/\">heritavia.vitalykhoruzhko.com →</a></p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"support-item\">\n            <h3>Project portfolio</h3>\n            <p>Everything in one hub: ALFAKIT · Semper · Heritavia.</p>\n            <p class=\"product-who\"><a href=\"https://vitalykhoruzhko.com/\">vitalykhoruzhko.com →</a></p>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section continuity\" id=\"continuity\" aria-labelledby=\"continuity-title\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <p class=\"section-kicker\">Executive risk</p>\n        <h2 id=\"continuity-title\">Continuity and handover</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-lead\">A critical TMS must not depend on “one person who keeps it all in their head”. We put the artefacts inside your perimeter.</p>\n        <ul class=\"continuity-grid\">\n          <li>\n            <h3>Contract and scope before we start</h3>\n            <p>The Care–Scale package, the priority matrix and the scope boundary are in the agreement. “One more field” is a change request, not a surprise on the invoice.</p>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <h3>Documentation stays with you</h3>\n            <p>The runbook for agents and rights, the list of customisations and incident decisions live in your repository (Confluence, an internal wiki or an NSF database).</p>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <h3>Artefact handover</h3>\n            <p>Sources for agents, forms and export scripts plus a restore procedure, on request within the contract. No vendor lock behind a closed binary.</p>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <h3>P1–P3 escalation</h3>\n            <p>Priorities and targets are in the agreement. 24/7 is an option on top of Scale. Legal entity details and a contract template on request to info@alfakit.by.</p>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section faq\" id=\"faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <p class=\"section-kicker\">FAQ</p>\n        <h2 id=\"faq-title\">Frequent questions</h2>\n        <div class=\"faq-list\">\n          <details>\n            <summary>Do you replace our IBM Domino or HCL Notes?</summary>\n            <p>No. We support and customise the live installation. ALFAKIT NEXT is a phased roadmap, not a blind core replacement. A big-bang migration is not our default proposal.</p>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>Do you offer an audit of the current installation as a service?</summary>\n            <p>Yes, and it is the usual way to start. From €900, 5–10 business days. You get a written report, a risk register, an inventory of customisations and a prioritised work list estimated in hours. The fee is credited against a support agreement signed within 30 days, and the report is yours either way. See <a href=\"#audit\">System audit</a>.</p>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>How much does support cost?</summary>\n            <p>Indicative: Care from €750/mo, Growth from €1,800, Scale from €3,500, Incident from €350. Final pricing follows the system audit. The hour bank and the −10…15% annual discount are in the packages block.</p>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>What is covered by the SLA?</summary>\n            <p>P1 within 2 business hours for first response, P2 within 4 business hours, P3 within 1 business day. Recovery targets are in the matrix above. Support hours and escalation are fixed in the package agreement.</p>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>Can you upgrade Domino to a current version?</summary>\n            <p>Yes, as a separate engagement: audit and customisation inventory first, then the upgrade in a test environment, verification of agents and integrations, and only then production. We also review the HCL licensing model — it can often be simplified and made cheaper.</p>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>Do you only work with PROLOG and ALFAKIT?</summary>\n            <p>The main focus is logistics TMS on Domino. We also take other NSF, CRM and document-flow estates on IBM Domino / HCL Notes when the work sits in LotusScript, Java, ACL or integrations.</p>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>Can you train our administrator?</summary>\n            <p>Yes. We walk through logs, rights, agent restarts and standard diagnostics together with your staff and leave a written runbook. The point is that routine work stays inside your team.</p>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>Where do data warehousing and call AI sit?</summary>\n            <p>In the Semper In Motu track: data, warehouses, ALFAKIT SMART, KPI pilots. alfakit.by stays the Domino specialist without mixing the two.</p>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>How do I request a module estimate?</summary>\n            <p>The catalogue is on the <a href=\"/modules.html\">modules page</a>. Describe your installation and the module in the form below or write to info@alfakit.by — we return an hour estimate and a matching package.</p>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>What if the key developer is unavailable?</summary>\n            <p>See the continuity block: documentation and sources inside your perimeter, handover per contract. That covers the bus-factor question better than promising a “team of twenty” that does not exist.</p>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>Can we join the ALFAKIT NEXT waitlist?</summary>\n            <p>Yes — pick the “NEXT roadmap” topic in the form. The pilot and cutover are planned after a process and data audit, not as a weekend move.</p>\n          </details>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section contact\" id=\"contact\" aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\">\n      <div class=\"wrap contact-inner\">\n        <h2 id=\"contact-title\">Contact</h2>\n        <p class=\"form-status\" data-form-status tabindex=\"-1\" hidden>Message sent. We will reply to the address you provided.</p>\n        <div class=\"contact-grid\">\n          <div class=\"contact-info\">\n            <p class=\"contact-name\">Vitaly Khoruzhko</p>\n            <p class=\"contact-lead\">Describe your Domino installation and the task — you get an estimate, a matching Care–Scale package or a roadmap consultation for NEXT.</p>\n            <ul class=\"contact-channels\">\n              <li><span class=\"contact-label\">Email</span><a href=\"mailto:info@alfakit.by?subject=ALFAKIT%20Care\">info@alfakit.by</a></li>\n              <li><span class=\"contact-label\">Phone</span><a href=\"tel:+375296757858\">+375&nbsp;29&nbsp;675-78-58</a></li>\n              <li><span class=\"contact-label\">Telegram</span><a href=\"https://t.me/N_FT210993\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Telegram</a></li>\n              <li><span class=\"contact-label\">WhatsApp</span><a href=\"https://wa.me/375296757858\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WhatsApp</a></li>\n              <li><span class=\"contact-label\">LinkedIn</span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/vitalykhoruzhko\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">linkedin.com/in/vitalykhoruzhko</a></li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"contact-actions\">\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"link-copy\" data-copy=\"info@alfakit.by\" data-copied-label=\"Copied\">Copy email</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <form class=\"lead-form\" action=\"https://formsubmit.co/info@alfakit.by\" method=\"POST\">\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_subject\" value=\"ALFAKIT Care — enquiry\" />\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_template\" value=\"table\" />\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_captcha\" value=\"false\" />\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_next\" value=\"https://alfakit.by/?sent=1#contact\" />\n            <input type=\"text\" name=\"_honey\" value=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;left:-9999px;height:0;width:0;opacity:0\" />\n            <div class=\"form-row\">\n              <label>Name<input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" required autocomplete=\"name\" /></label>\n              <label>Email<input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required autocomplete=\"email\" /></label>\n            </div>\n            <label>Company / installation<input type=\"text\" name=\"company\" autocomplete=\"organization\" placeholder=\"PROLOG / ALFAKIT / other Domino\" /></label>\n            <label>Topic\n              <select name=\"topic\" required>\n                <option value=\"audit\">System audit</option>\n                <option value=\"support\">Support and response times</option>\n                <option value=\"module\">Module estimate</option>\n                <option value=\"process\">Process optimisation</option>\n                <option value=\"upgrade\">Domino version upgrade</option>\n                <option value=\"package\">Care–Scale package</option>\n                <option value=\"next\">NEXT roadmap</option>\n                <option value=\"other\">Other</option>\n              </select>\n            </label>\n            <label>Task<textarea name=\"message\" required placeholder=\"Symptom, roles, urgency P1–P3\"></textarea></label>\n            <p class=\"form-note\">The form sends an email to info@alfakit.by. We use your data only to answer the enquiry.</p>\n            <div class=\"form-actions\">\n              <button class=\"btn btn-lg\" type=\"submit\">Send enquiry</button>\n            </div>\n          </form>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>";
